    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Chicken Chettinad serves 4 and takes about 60 minutes. Roast the whole spices until fragrant before grinding, as this is the soul of the dish. Watch them closely so they do not burn."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Grind the roasted spices fresh for the deepest, boldest flavour."
          }
        ]
      },
